{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981850/extras/slime_princess_banner_600x100px.png?t=1747183092\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story background</h2>The cute slime princess was kidnapped by the big devil Haben. In order to save the princess, the little slime went deep into the randomly changing dungeon, fought with various monsters, and finally defeated the BOSS. In the process, a larger The secret gradually surfaced...<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981850/extras/SlimePrincess_Demo_GamePlay_3_OK.gif?t=1747183092\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features</h2><strong>Pixel style</strong>: Exquisite pixel painting style, coupled with refreshing combat, feel the wonderful adventure atmosphere!<br><strong>Roguelike elements</strong>: Every time you enter a dungeon, levels will be randomly generated, and the positions of enemies and treasure chests will also change, making every experience fresh for players. In addition, the game also has a permanent death mechanism. Players need to act carefully to avoid falling into traps or being defeated by enemies;<br><strong>Rich weapons and props</strong>: The game has a rich weapon and prop system, which allows players to explore dungeons with ease through collection and combination;<br><strong>Hidden content</strong>: In addition to the rich main line battles, the randomly appearing hidden room contents are also worth exploring. This is the place with the highest probability of treasure chests appearing!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981850/extras/SlimePrincess_Demo_GamePlay_4_OK.gif?t=1747183092\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat Skills</h2>When facing projectiles from long-range enemies, players can also use the anti-rebound attac